, their）"],"dialogueTheme":"交友与自我介绍（make friends, get to know each other），介绍个人信息（full name, first name, last name），谈论爱好和背景（I'm from... / I like... / Would you like to...）"},{"unitNumber":"Unit 2","title":"We're Family!","topic":"Family members and family activities","words":[{"word":"family","meaning":"家；家庭；家人"},{"word":"father","meaning":"父亲；爸爸"},{"word":"mother","meaning":"母亲；妈妈"},{"word":"parent","meaning":"父（母）亲（复数parents）"},{"word":"grandfather","meaning":"祖父；外祖父"},{"word":"grandmother","meaning":"祖母；外祖母"},{"word":"uncle","meaning":"叔父；伯父；舅父；姑父；姨父"},{"word":"aunt","meaning":"姑母；姨母；伯母；婶母；舅母"},{"word":"cousin","meaning":"堂（表）兄/弟/姐/妹"},{"word":"son","meaning":"儿子"},{"word":"daughter","meaning":"女儿"},{"word":"husband","meaning":"丈夫"},{"word":"wife","meaning":"妻子"},{"word":"brother","meaning":"兄；弟"},{"word":"sister","meaning":"姐；妹"},{"word":"photo","meaning":"照片（复数photos）"},{"word":"mean","meaning":"意思是；打算"},{"word":"together","meaning":"一起；共同"},{"word":"activity","meaning":"活动（复数activities）"},{"word":"chess","meaning":"国际象棋"}],"grammar":["指示代词this/that/these/those：近处用this/these，远处用that/those，后接be动词is/are","名词所有格：表示所属关系（如father's, mother's, Tom's）；Whose引导的特殊疑问句"],"dialogueTheme":"介绍家庭成员（This is my... / These are my...），谈论家庭活动（play ping-pong, play the piano, go fishing），询问物品归属（Whose... is this?）"},{"unitNumber":"Unit 3","title":"My School","topic":"School buildings and classroom descriptions","words":[{"word":"hall","meaning":"礼堂；大厅"},{"word":"building","meaning":"建筑物；房子"},{"word":"across","meaning":"过；穿过"},{"word":"field","meaning":"场地；田地"},{"word":"gym","meaning":"体育馆；健身房"},{"word":"office","meaning":"办公室"},{"word":"large","meaning":"大的；大号的"},{"word":"special","meaning":"特别的；特殊的"},{"word":"smart","meaning":"智能的"},{"word":"library","meaning":"图书馆"},{"word":"classroom","meaning":"教室"},{"word":"modern","meaning":"现代的；当代的"},{"word":"screen","meaning":"屏幕；银幕"},{"word":"bookcase","meaning":"书架；书柜"},{"word":"drawer","meaning":"抽屉"},{"word":"corner","meaning":"角；墙角；街角"},{"