ing":"某事；某物"},{"word":"sale","meaning":"出售；销售"},{"word":"kilo","meaning":"千克；公斤"},{"word":"yogurt","meaning":"酸奶"},{"word":"total","meaning":"总数；合计；总的"},{"word":"price","meaning":"价格"},{"word":"balloon","meaning":"气球"},{"word":"chocolate","meaning":"巧克力"},{"word":"pizza","meaning":"比萨饼"},{"word":"list","meaning":"列表；列清单；名单"},{"word":"own","meaning":"自己的；本人"},{"word":"example","meaning":"例子；范例"},{"word":"language","meaning":"语言"},{"word":"international","meaning":"国际的"},{"word":"national","meaning":"国家的；民族的"},{"word":"mark","meaning":"做记号；分数"},{"word":"date","meaning":"日期；日子"},{"word":"meaningful","meaning":"重要的；有意义的"}],"grammar":["When引导的特殊疑问句询问日期及回答：When is your birthday? — It's on 2nd August.（日期表达：序数词+月份）","How much/How many的用法：How much is/are...?（询问价格），How many... do you want?（询问数量）"],"dialogueTheme":"谈论生日和庆祝活动（When is your birthday? — It's on...），购物对话（How much is/are...? — It's/They're... yuan a kilo），表达生日祝福和愿望"}]
